[{"id":"cnm_077_q1","topicId":"cnm_077","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"√2 是有理数还是无理数？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"无理数"},{"key":"B","text":"有理数"},{"key":"C","text":"既不是有理数也不是无理数"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"√2 是无限不循环小数（1.41421356…），所以是无理数。"},{"id":"cnm_077_q2","topicId":"cnm_077","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"下列各数中，是无理数的是","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"22/7"},{"key":"B","text":"0.101"},{"key":"C","text":"√16"},{"key":"D","text":"π"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"22/7 是分数，0.101 是有限小数，√16=4 是整数，都是有理数；π 是无限不循环小数，是无理数。"},{"id":"cnm_077_q3","topicId":"cnm_077","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"下列各数：3.14、√5、-π、0.1010010001…（相邻两个 1 之间依次多一个 0）、√16、22/7、∛8，其中无理数共有几个？","answer":"3","explanation":"√5、-π 和 0.1010010001…（无限不循环）是无理数；3.14、√16=4、22/7、∛8=2 都是有理数，共 3 个。"},{"id":"cnm_077_q4","topicId":"cnm_077","difficulty":"advanced","type":"choice","prompt":"下列说法正确的是","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"无限小数都是无理数"},{"key":"B","text":"带根号的数都是无理数"},{"key":"C","text":"无理数都是无限不循环小数"},{"key":"D","text":"两个无理数的和一定是无理数"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"0.333… 是无限小数但是有理数，√4=2 带根号但是有理数，√2+(-√2)=0 是有理数，所以 A、B、D 都错；无理数就是无限不循环小数，C 正确。"},{"id":"cnm_078_q1","topicId":"cnm_078","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"π 对应数轴上哪个位置附近？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"0 和 1 之间"},{"key":"B","text":"2 和 3 之间"},{"key":"C","text":"3 和 4 之间，约 3.14"},{"key":"D","text":"4 和 5 之间"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"π≈3.14159，介于 3 和 4 之间，在 3 的右边约 0.14 处。"},{"id":"cnm_078_q2","topicId":"cnm_078","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"在实数 -2、0、√3、1/2、π、-√9 中，有理数共有几个？","answer":"4","explanation":"-√9=-3，所以 -2、0、1/2、-3 是有理数，√3 与 π 是无理数，共 4 个。"},{"id":"cnm_078_q3","topicId":"cnm_078","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"绝对值小于 √10 的整数共有几个？","answer":"7","explanation":"√10≈3.16，要求 |x|<3.16 的整数，即 -3、-2、-1、0、1、2、3，共 7 个。","verify":"len([x for x in range(-10,11) if x*x<10])"},{"id":"cnm_078_q4","topicId":"cnm_078","difficulty":"advanced","type":"choice","prompt":"下列说法正确的是","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"实数与数轴上的点一一对应"},{"key":"B","text":"数轴上的点都表示有理数"},{"key":"C","text":"实数分为正实数和负实数两类"},{"key":"D","text":"0 既不是有理数也不是无理数"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"数轴上的点既有有理数点也有无理数点，实数与数轴上的点一一对应；实数分为正实数、0、负实数三类；0 是有理数。"},{"id":"cnm_079_q1","topicId":"cnm_079","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"估计 √10 在哪两个整数之间。（填较小的那个整数）","answer":"3","explanation":"因为 9<10<16，所以 3<√10<4，较小的整数是 3。","verify":"floor(sqrt(10))"},{"id":"cnm_079_q2","topicId":"cnm_079","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"√30 在相邻的两个整数之间，较大的那个整数是多少？","answer":"6","explanation":"25<30<36，所以 5<√30<6，较大的整数是 6。","verify":"ceil(sqrt(30))"},{"id":"cnm_079_q3","topicId":"cnm_079","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"比较 √5 与 2.2 的大小，正确的是","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"√5 < 2.2"},{"key":"B","text":"√5 > 2.2"},{"key":"C","text":"√5 = 2.2"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"2.2^2=4.84<5，而两个正数中平方大的数更大，所以 √5>2.2。"},{"id":"cnm_079_q4","topicId":"cnm_079","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"√47 - 2 在相邻的两个整数之间，较小的那个整数是多少？","answer":"4","explanation":"36<47<49，所以 6<√47<7，减去 2 得 4<√47-2<5，较小的整数是 4。","verify":"floor(sqrt(47)-2)"},{"id":"cnm_079_q5","topicId":"cnm_079","difficulty":"advanced","type":"numeric","prompt":"满足 √11 < n < √90 的整数 n 共有几个？","answer":"6","explanation":"9<11<16 得 3<√11<4；81<90<100 得 9<√90<10。所以 n 可取 4、5、6、7、8、9，共 6 个。","verify":"len([n for n in range(0,20) if 11<n*n<90])"},{"id":"cnm_080_q1","topicId":"cnm_080","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"计算 √9+∛(-8)-|1-√2|。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"√2"},{"key":"B","text":"-√2"},{"key":"C","text":"6-√2"},{"key":"D","text":"2-√2"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"√9=3，∛(-8)=-2，因为 1-√2<0，所以 |1-√2|=√2-1。原式=3-2-(√2-1)=2-√2。"},{"id":"cnm_080_q2","topicId":"cnm_080","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"计算 √16+∛27-√4。","answer":"5","explanation":"√16=4，∛27=3，√4=2，原式=4+3-2=5。","verify":"isqrt(16)+round(27**(1/3))-isqrt(4)"},{"id":"cnm_080_q3","topicId":"cnm_080","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"计算 (-√3)² + |-2| - ∛(-8)。","answer":"7","explanation":"(-√3)²=3，|-2|=2，∛(-8)=-2，原式=3+2-(-2)=7。","verify":"3+abs(-2)-(-round(8**(1/3)))"},{"id":"cnm_080_q4","topicId":"cnm_080","difficulty":"advanced","type":"numeric","prompt":"计算 (√2+1)² + (√2-1)²。","answer":"6","explanation":"(√2+1)²=2+2√2+1=3+2√2，(√2-1)²=3-2√2，两式相加，含 √2 的项抵消，得 6。","verify":"(2+1)+(2+1)"},{"id":"cnm_080_q5","topicId":"cnm_080","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"已知 √3≈1.732，计算 2√3 - 1 的近似值，结果精确到 0.01。","answer":"2.46","explanation":"2√3-1≈2×1.732-1=2.464，精确到 0.01 得 2.46。","verify":"round(2*1.732-1,2)"}]
